[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, it is essential to carry out the following preliminary operations:\n(1) turn the ignition off and take out the key; (2) disconnect the\nbattery termnals and insulate them; (3) wait 10 minutes before proceeding.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (see assembly 5508C - AIR BAG SYSTEM).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing the steering wheel,\nposition the wheels as parallel as possible to the car&#x27;s longitudinal\naxis.</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p>Remove the complete glove compartment as\ndescribed in the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753179\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753359\">7210E36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753193\">7040A98</a></p><p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the condensate tray.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046893.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the condensate tray and\ntighten the fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753193\">7040A98</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753359\">7210E36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753179\">7040A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a></p><p>Fit the complete glove compartment as described\nin the procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752379\">0010T21</a></p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p><p>Check the operation of the Air Bag system\nusing the Examiner or other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]